# SyntrixAI request flows

FastAPI modular monolith with Ollama for chat and embeddings, PostgreSQL for conversations and document metadata, Qdrant for vectors, and OpenTelemetry for traces and metrics. Built from the code under src/syntrix_ai.

System

## Architecture overview

Routes call application services. Services depend on domain interfaces, and infrastructure adapters implement them.

```mermaid
flowchart LR
  Client([Client]) --> API["FastAPI /api/v1health, llm, conversations,chat, documents, retrieval, answers"]
  API --> G["Guardrailsinput validation +prompt injection guard"]
  API --> CS[Conversation services]
  API --> RAG[RAG services]
  G --> LLM[LLM service]
  CS --> LLM
  RAG --> LLM
  LLM --> PF[Provider factory]
  PF --> OL["Ollama chat modelretry + error handling"]
  RAG --> EMB[Ollama embeddings]
  RAG --> QD[("Qdrantvectors")]
  CS --> PG[("PostgreSQLconversations, messages, documents")]
  RAG --> PG
  API -. spans, metrics .-> OT[OTel collector]
  OT --> JG[Jaeger]
  API -. /metrics .-> PR[Prometheus]
  PR --> GF[Grafana]
```

Chat

## Conversation chat

POST /conversations/{id}/chat. The streaming variant, /chat/stream, checks the conversation first, then sends token events over SSE and saves the full reply at the end.

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant R as chat route
  participant S as ConversationChatService
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant L as LLMService / Ollama
  C->>R: POST content
  R->>S: chat(conversation_id, content)
  S->>DB: save user message
  alt conversation not found
    S-->>R: None
    R-->>C: 404
  else found
    S->>DB: load last 50 messages
    S->>L: generate(history)
    L-->>S: content + token usage
    S->>DB: save assistant message
    S-->>R: ChatResponse
    R-->>C: 200
  end
  Note over R,C: Any exception returns 502
```

Knowledge

## Document ingestion

POST /documents. Status moves from pending to processing to indexed, or to failed with the error saved.

```mermaid
flowchart TD
  U([Upload file]) --> A["Create document recordstatus = pending"]
  A --> B[status = processing]
  B --> C["Pick loader by filenameand content typePDF, DOCX, text"]
  C --> D[Extract text]
  D --> E[Split into chunks]
  E --> F{Any chunks?}
  F -- no --> X
  F -- yes --> G[Embed chunks with Ollama]
  G --> H{Embedding countequals chunk count?}
  H -- no --> X
  H -- yes --> I[Upsert vectors to Qdrant]
  I --> J["status = indexed"]
  J --> K([Return chunk count + dimension])
  X["Rollback, status = failedsave error message"] --> Y([Raise error])
```

