## RAG answer

POST /answers. Input is validated and checked for prompt injection first. With a conversation id, history is loaded and the question is rewritten into a standalone search query.

```mermaid
flowchart TD
  Q([Question]) --> V["Validate inputmax 12,000 chars"]
  V --> P{Prompt injectiondetected?}
  P -- yes --> BL([Blocked])
  P -- no --> CID{conversation_idgiven?}
  CID -- yes --> H[Load last 20 user and assistant messages]
  H --> RW["Rewrite follow-up asstandalone query (LLM, temp 0)"]
  RW --> SU[Save user message]
  SU --> EM
  CID -- no --> EM[Embed query]
  EM --> QS["Search Qdrantfilter by tenant and knowledge basetop_k, score threshold"]
  QS --> CTX["Build context with source labels S1, S2, ...wrapped as untrusted reference material"]
  CTX --> PR["Prompt = system rules + history + question + context"]
  PR --> GEN["LLM generatetemp 0.2, max 1000 tokens"]
  GEN --> SA{conversation_id?}
  SA -- yes --> SAVE[Save assistant message with usage]
  SA -- no --> OUT
  SAVE --> OUT([Answer + cited sources])
```

Security

## Guardrails on /llm/generate and /answers

The conversation chat routes do not call the guardrails in the current code.

```mermaid
flowchart LR
  In([User input]) --> IV[InputValidationService]
  IV -->|too long or empty| R1([Rejected])
  IV -->|ok| PD[PromptInjectionDetectorpattern matching]
  PD -->|match| R2([PromptInjectionBlockedError])
  PD -->|clean| Go([Continue to LLM or retrieval])
```
